{"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "009H", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\mathcal{C}, F)$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Sh(\\mathcal{B}, \\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\Sh(X, \\mathcal{C})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\Sh(\\mathcal{B}, \\mathcal{C})\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$X$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{B}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-restrict-basis-equivalence-structures}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f78691fe8f3c5a3474d17da697be079e86073ff68a5b8c92f3dee3676595a5bc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:15fd7d6c2562ebf12c8b21983eca4164ec8a6f7b214ce769448efacb7b6ba32e", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a topological space.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a basis for the topology on <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a type of algebraic structure.\nDenote <MATH_0005> the category of\nsheaves with values in <MATH_0006> on <MATH_0007>.\nThere is an equivalence of categories\n<MATH_0008>\nwhich assigns to a sheaf on <MATH_0009> its restriction to\nthe members of <MATH_0010>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:dbe709bd79de256143ce929b9bc28e4f219ed6db64110397c387065666d14745", "unit_id": "tag:009R:statement"}
